Let me formalize:
For a URL u:
1. if '...' in u → TRUNCATED
2. if 'api/query' in u or '?q=' in u or 'search?' in u or '/search' in u → DISCOVERY_QUERY
3. if re.search(r'inspirehep\.net/api/literature/\d+', u) → RECORD
4. if re.search(r'api\.crossref\.org/works/10\.', u) → RECORD
5. if re.search(r'api\.openalex\.org/works/doi:', u) → RECORD
6. if 'doi.org/' in u or u.startswith('10.') → RECORD (DOI)
7. if 'arxiv.org/abs/' in u → RECORD
8. if 'api.' in u or '/api/' in u → METADATA_ENDPOINT (no record id)
9. else → RECORD_PAGE (publisher page)

